        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>怀孕第 2 个月要做的事</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border: 10px solid #ffe066;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 18px 16px 26px 16px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 18px 0;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #d9d9d9;\n    padding-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  td, th {\n    border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    padding: 8px 6px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .sec-blue {\n    background: #d9ecf2;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 7px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-green {\n    background: #eaf25f;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 7px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-yellow {\n    background: #ffe066;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 7px 0;\n  }\n  .hd { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; }\n  .c { text-align: center; }\n  .lbl { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; width: 88px; }\n  .row-food { position: relative; }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 118px;\n    height: 96px;\n    float: right;\n    margin: -34px 0 0 8px;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #777;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  .listcell { line-height: 2.0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1>怀孕第 2 个月要做的事</h1>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr><td class=\"sec-blue\" colspan=\"4\">孕检</td></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"hd\" style=\"width:88px;\">孕周</td>\n      <td class=\"hd\" style=\"width:96px;\">检查项目</td>\n      <td class=\"hd\" style=\"width:110px;\">检查目的</td>\n      <td class=\"hd\">注意事项</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"c\">孕 6-9 周</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">抽血<br>B 超</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">看胎心、胎芽<br>确认宫内孕</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">不建议太早去，太小不容易检查到，<br>第一次 B 超建议准爸爸陪同</td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr><td class=\"sec-green\" colspan=\"4\">饮食指南</td></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">重要营养</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"c\">叶酸、维 B6、C（缓解孕吐，预防妊娠期牙龈炎）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">饮食重点</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"c\">少食多餐，饮食均衡</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"4\">①食补：鱼肉、鸡肉、芹菜、南瓜、西红柿、小白菜、草莓、金桔</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"listcell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[照片：水果沙拉，右侧]</div>\n        ②推荐食谱：番茄鸡蛋面、醋溜白菜、豌豆炒虾仁、清蒸鲈鱼、<br>\n        彩椒炒扇片、蒜蓉粉丝蒸丝瓜、酸奶水果沙拉、香橙苹果汁\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"4\">③饮食禁忌：不吃保健品如天麻、人参、西洋参、灵芝、胖大海</td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr><td class=\"sec-yellow\" colspan=\"4\">重点事项</td></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">胎儿变化</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\">心脏有规律地跳动，四肢开始长出，眼晴清晰可辨</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">孕妈变化</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\">子宫增大如鹅蛋大小，阴道分泌物增多，恶心、厌食、呕吐</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">注意事项</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"listcell\">\n        ①避免尿路感染，多喝水，勤换内裤，每天用温水冲洗外阴<br>\n        ②可以使用护肤品，不要用功效型产品如美白、祛斑等<br>\n        ③避免用力的动作，不提重物、不干重活<br>\n        ④这个时期可能出现早孕反应身体不适，不擅自用药需遵医嘱\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
